}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "status": "completed",
    "notes": "Checked out. Excellent service, room was amazing with stunning views. Staff very helpful. Would definitely stay again!"
  }
}

docs {
  # Update Booking

  Updates an existing booking. All fields are optional - only send fields you want to change.

  ## URL Parameters
  - `booking_id`: The ID of the booking to update

  ## Updatable Fields
  All fields from BookingUpdate schema are optional:
  - `booking_type`: Booking type enum
  - `name`: Booking name
  - `provider`: Provider/vendor name
  - `confirmation_number`: Confirmation number
  - `booking_reference`: Secondary reference
  - `cost`: Cost amount
  - `currency`: ISO currency code
  - `booking_date`: Date of booking
  - `booking_time`: Time (HH:MM format)
  - `location`: Location name
  - `location_address`: Full address
  - `contact_phone`: Provider phone
  - `contact_email`: Provider email
  - `booking_url`: Management URL
  - `status`: Status enum (pending, confirmed, completed, cancelled)
  - `notes`: Additional notes

  ## Common Use Cases

  **Mark as completed after stay:**
  ```json
  {
    "status": "completed",
    "notes": "Great experience!"
  }
  ```

  **Update confirmation after receiving:**
  ```json
  {
    "status": "confirmed",
    "confirmation_number": "UPDATED-12345",
    "notes": "Received confirmation email"
  }
  ```

  **Cancel reservation:**
  ```json
  {
    "status": "cancelled",
    "notes": "Cancelled due to itinerary change. Refund pending."
  }
  ```

  **Update contact info:**
  ```json
  {
    "contact_phone": "+81-3-1234-5678",
    "contact_email": "updated@example.com"
  }
  ```

  ## Status Workflow
  1. `pending` → Just made reservation, awaiting confirmation
  2. `confirmed` → Received confirmation number/email
  3. `completed` → Service used/stay finished
  4. `cancelled` → Reservation cancelled

  ## Access Control
  - Requires authentication
  - User must own the trip
  - Returns 403 if unauthorized
}
